 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting(8)': You Can Either Profit By This... / Or Be Destroyed, Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber, Tatooine: Jabba's Palace, Han With Heavy Blaster Pistol, Heading For The Medical Frigate, Strike Planning, Insurrection, Staging Areas; these count toward the 60. Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "The post is tagged Light (a Light Profit deck); the draft had it as Dark with several wrong fuzzy matches, all corrected to the posted Light cards.",
  "Posted 'Tatooine Jabba's Palace' dested the Light Special Edition site Tatooine: Jabba's Palace; 'Tatooine Cantina' Tatooine: Cantina (Light); 'Jabba's Palace Entrance Cavern' the Light Jabba's Palace: Entrance Cavern.",
  "Posted 'Dash' (in the Interrupts section) dested the Cloud City Used Interrupt Dash, used to react (per the strategy); 'Lieutant Page' = Lieutenant Page; 'Orrimarko' = Orrimaarko.",
  "Same author's 'Profit the Prototype' (DeckTech 14712, 19 March 2001) is the first version: this list swaps Lieutenant Greeve for Corporal Kensaric and Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber (location section) for Jabba's Palace: Entrance Cavern.",
  "No Tatooine-set cards; total 60 as posted."
